sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Khách Hàng
    participant Controller as OrderController
    participant UseCase as CreateOrderUseCase
    participant CodeRepo as DiscountCodeRepositoryPort
    participant Engine as DiscountAllocationEngine
    participant MasterRepo as MasterOrderRepository
    participant SubOrderRepo as SubOrderRepository
    participant RedemptionRepo as DiscountRedemptionRepository
    participant EventPublisher as ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Customer->>Controller: POST /api/orders (bookingId, discountCode)
    Note over Customer,Controller: Header: Idempotency-Key, Authorization: Bearer JWT

    Controller->>UseCase: execute(command)
    activate UseCase

    Note over UseCase: Kiểm tra Idempotency & IDOR trên Booking và Order cũ

    alt Có áp dụng mã giảm giá (discountCode != null)
        UseCase->>CodeRepo: findByCodeForUpdate(cleanCode)
        CodeRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM discount_codes WHERE UPPER(code) = UPPER(?) FOR UPDATE
        DB-->>CodeRepo: DiscountCodeEntity (ĐÃ KHÓA BI QUAN)
        CodeRepo-->>UseCase: code

        alt Quota đã hết (usedCount >= maxUses)
            UseCase-->>Controller: throw QuotaExceededException (400)
            Controller-->>Customer: 400 Bad Request (DISCOUNT_QUOTA_EXCEEDED)
        end

        UseCase->>Engine: evaluateAndAllocate(items, code)
        Engine-->>UseCase: AllocationResult (tiền giảm từng item, finalPayableAmount)

        UseCase->>CodeRepo: incrementUsedCountAtomic(code.getId())
        CodeRepo->>DB: UPDATE discount_codes SET used_count = used_count + 1 WHERE id = ? AND used_count < max_uses
        DB-->>CodeRepo: 1 row affected
    end

    UseCase->>MasterRepo: save(masterOrder)
    MasterRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO master_orders (id, customer_id, total_amount, discount_amount, ...)
    DB-->>MasterRepo: Saved

    loop Với từng BookingItem tách SubOrder 1:1
        UseCase->>SubOrderRepo: save(subOrder)
        SubOrderRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO sub_orders (final_amount, commission_basis_amount, commission_amount, vendor_payout_amount, ...)
    end

    alt Có áp dụng mã giảm giá
        UseCase->>RedemptionRepo: save(redemption)
        RedemptionRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO discount_redemptions (discount_code_id, master_order_id, customer_id, amount_deducted)
    end

    UseCase->>DB: UPDATE bookings SET status = 'PENDING_PAYMENT' WHERE id = ?
    UseCase->>EventPublisher: publishEvent(new OrderCreatedEvent(orderId))

    UseCase-->>Controller: OrderCreatedResponse(orderId, totalAmount, subOrders)
    deactivate UseCase

    Controller-->>Customer: 201 Created (orderId, chi tiết thanh toán)
